Hi there,

Thanks for reaching out! Our studio designs bird and nature drinkware (made by our partner factory in Xiamen). Quote below, photos attached.

A) CO9SP4ASL - Snowbird Coffee Cup, ceramic artisanal, 4 assorted designs (chickadee and other winter birds), 11 oz
- Collection: Forest Lodge / Snowbirds. Season: Winter, Christmas
- Size 5.15 x 3.54 x 4.85 in, weight 0.97 lb
- Stoneware, dishwasher safe (top rack), packed in a craft box
- Artist: EveArt
- USD 3.25 per pc FOB Xiamen
- MOQ 100 pcs per design
- Production 35 days + 30 days sea freight
- Made in China, final assembly in China

B) TK28V5CER226 - Cottage Garden Perfect Cup "Birds", 17 oz
- Size 7 x 5.24 x 3.55 in, weight 1.21 lb
- Stoneware cup, PP lid, silicone seal. Dishwasher safe, top rack
- Artist: EveArt
- USD 4.95 per pc FOB Xiamen, MOQ 600 pcs
- Production 50 days + 25 days sea freight
- Made in China

Winter items: please place the PO by 15 June to land before November.
Samples: USD 20 per piece, credited against the order.
Compliance: FDA and LFGB reports available.

Warm regards,
Maria Santos
Feathered Friends Studio

